  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source digital pathology platform — the 3D Slicer of computational pathology. Used in virtually every digital pathology research lab globally for annotation, segmentation, and classification workflows. GPL-3.0, v0.7.0 (March 2026), 1.4k stars, Wellcome Trust and Chan Zuckerberg Initiative funded. Integrates with StarDist, OMERO, and ImageJ. Essential for any team building on WSI data without a commercial pathology platform.",
